00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:21,400
He has trouble staying in his lane.

250
00:14:21,660 --> 00:14:25,380
Last winter I went up on a church lawn and drove right through a manger scene.

251
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:27,340
The papers thought it was a hate crime.

252
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:34,360
- Anyway, it was lovely seeing you. - Okay.

253
00:14:34,602 --> 00:14:36,900
- Bye. Bye, dear. - Nighty-night.

254
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:37,820
- Nighty-night. - Bye.

255
00:14:40,060 --> 00:14:41,360
How could you just let them leave?

256
00:14:41,600 --> 00:14:42,080
Hey, hey, hey.

257
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,160
I'm not gonna mess with Jack.

258
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:44,920
He's a great man. He fought for our country.

259
00:14:46,020 --> 00:14:47,080
No, he didn't.

260
00:14:47,260 --> 00:14:49,480
He pretended to be a Quaker to get out of Korea.

261
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:52,800
Well, that's it. He's the last one to go.

262
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,420
I'm locking you guys in.

263
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,820
You do know I can just turn them the other way around, right?

264
00:15:00,400 --> 00:15:01,780
Oh, I forgot you used to live here.

265
00:15:08,260 --> 00:15:10,020
- Hello? - Joey, it's Estelle.

266
00:15:10,500 --> 00:15:13,580
- Hey. - So how'd your audition go today?

267
00:15:14,020 --> 00:15:14,700
What audition?

268
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:17,200
The one I told you about last week.

269
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:19,320
What? You never said anything about an audition.

270
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:24,280
Let me start over.

271
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:27,480
I just got a call about an audition.

272
00:15:28,760 --> 00:15:30,460
I think you can still make it.

273
00:15:30,640 --> 00:15:34,720
It's down at the Astor Theater, and you need to have a monologue prepared.

274
00:15:35,180 --> 00:15:36,980
A monologue? I don't have a--

275
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:41,880
I got it.

276
00:15:44,260 --> 00:15:46,200
So I'm gonna take off.

277
00:15:46,540 --> 00:15:47,140
What?

278
00:15:47,300 --> 00:15:48,900
No, wait! You don't get to leave.

279
00:15:49,040 --> 00:15:52,160
I've got a massage client waiting outside my door any minute.

280
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:55,500
And we paid for a room that we're supposed to be in right now!

281
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:59,240
Well, okay, now only one of us has to stay with Emma.

282
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:03,160
Okay, and as the person who realized that, I get to go.

283
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,130
No...

284
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:08,140
